          'JD -> skillset (~20-30 items). The selected source mix is evaluated -> tournament result views (Daily Talent Dose + Full Talent Pool).',
          'Evaluation = ranking/curation engine between raw intake and pipeline progression; humans decide who enters the active journey. Actions: evaluate again, refine tournament, add candidates, inspect skillsets+job settings, export/download.',
          'Skillset items are EvaluationConfigItem rows in one of two groups: eligibility gate (pass/fail at a threshold) or weighted criterion (share of the overall score). applyPassingGatesFilter excludes gate failures from dose picking and from the result table.',
          'SCORE FORMULA (TournamentEvaluationPolicyService::gateAdjustedOverallScore): avg_score = weighted criteria mean * (passed_gates + 1) / (resolved_gates + 1), Laplace add-one on BOTH counts. Only gates that resolved to true/false are counted; a gate the AI could not score at all is excluded from both sides. Passing every gate, or having no resolved gate, returns the criteria mean untouched. criteria_score ships alongside avg_score as the unscaled number.',
