          'Weight and threshold are changed from the weight or threshold shown on the item itself.  Applying a value there updates the board only; nothing reaches candidate scoring until the board is saved as a new version.',
          'Opening an item shows it read only.  Editing its wording is a separate step, because that is the one change on this board that is re-evaluated by AI.',
